+Feature: TodoMVC
+  As a user managing tasks
+  I want to add, edit, complete, remove, and filter todos
+  So that I can track my work in a persistent list
+
+  Background:
+    Given the app is loaded with no existing todos
+
+  Scenario: New todo is created on Enter
+    When the user types "Buy milk" in the new-todo input and presses Enter
+    Then a todo "Buy milk" appears in the list
+    And the new-todo input is empty
+    And the todo count shows "1 item left"
+
+  Scenario: Empty input does not create a todo
+    When the user presses Enter without typing
+    Then no todos exist
+
+  Scenario: Whitespace-only input does not create a todo
+    When the user types "   " in the new-todo input and presses Enter
+    Then no todos exist
+
+  Scenario: Multiple todos accumulate
+    When the user types "Buy milk" in the new-todo input and presses Enter
+    And the user types "Walk dog" in the new-todo input and presses Enter
+    Then the todo list shows 2 todos
+    And the todo count shows "2 items left"
+
+  Scenario: Completing a todo
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    And the user has added a todo "Walk dog"
+    When the user toggles the first todo
+    Then the first todo is marked completed
+    And the todo count shows "1 item left"
+
+  Scenario: Uncompleting a todo
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    And the user toggles the first todo
+    When the user toggles the first todo
+    Then the first todo is not marked completed
+    And the todo count shows "1 item left"
+
+  Scenario: Delete a todo
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    And the user has added a todo "Walk dog"
+    When the user deletes the first todo
+    Then the todo list shows 1 todo
+    And the remaining todo is "Walk dog"
+
+  Scenario: Edit a todo by double-clicking
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    When the user double-clicks the first todo label
+    And the user changes the edit input to "Buy soy milk" and presses Enter
+    Then the remaining todo is "Buy soy milk"
+
+  Scenario: Editing with empty input removes the todo
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    When the user double-clicks the first todo label
+    And the user clears the edit input and presses Enter
+    Then no todos exist
+
+  Scenario: Editing discards changes on Escape
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    When the user double-clicks the first todo label
+    And the user changes the edit input to "Changed" and presses Escape
+    Then the remaining todo is "Buy milk"
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed button removes completed todos
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    And the user has added a todo "Walk dog"
+    And the user toggles the first todo
+    When the user clicks "Clear completed"
+    Then the todo list shows 1 todo
+    And the remaining todo is "Walk dog"
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed button is hidden when no todos are completed
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    Then the "Clear completed" button is hidden
+
+  Scenario: Mark all as complete toggles all todos
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    And the user has added a todo "Walk dog"
+    When the user clicks the toggle-all checkbox
+    Then all todos are marked completed
+    And the todo count shows "0 items left"
+
+  Scenario: Mark all as complete unchecks when all are completed
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    And the user has added a todo "Walk dog"
+    And the user clicks the toggle-all checkbox
+    When the user clicks the toggle-all checkbox
+    Then no todos are marked completed
+    And the todo count shows "2 items left"
+
+  Scenario: Toggle-all reflects individual completion state
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    And the user has added a todo "Walk dog"
+    When the user toggles the first todo
+    Then the toggle-all checkbox is not checked
+
+  Scenario: Counter shows correct pluralization for zero items
+    Then the todo count shows "0 items left"
+
+  Scenario: Counter shows singular for one item
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo count shows "1 item left"
+
+  Scenario: Counter shows plural for multiple items
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    And the user has added a todo "Walk dog"
+    Then the todo count shows "2 items left"
+
+  Scenario: Main section and footer hidden when no todos
+    Then the main section is hidden
+    And the footer is hidden
+
+  Scenario: Main section and footer visible when todos exist
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    Then the main section is visible
+    And the footer is visible
+
+  Scenario: Filter link All shows all todos
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    And the user has added a todo "Walk dog"
+    And the user toggles the first todo
+    When the user navigates to "#/"
+    Then the todo list shows 2 todos
+    And the "All" filter is selected
+
+  Scenario: Filter link Active shows only active todos
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    And the user has added a todo "Walk dog"
+    And the user toggles the first todo
+    When the user navigates to "#/active"
+    Then the todo list shows 1 todo
+    And the remaining todo is "Walk dog"
+
+  Scenario: Filter link Completed shows only completed todos
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    And the user has added a todo "Walk dog"
+    And the user toggles the first todo
+    When the user navigates to "#/completed"
+    Then the todo list shows 1 todo
+    And the remaining todo is "Buy milk"
+
+  Scenario: Persistence across page reload
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    And the user has added a todo "Walk dog"
+    When the app is reloaded
+    Then the todo list shows 2 todos
+    And the remaining todo is "Buy milk"
+
+  Scenario: New todo input is focused on page load
+    Then the new-todo input is focused
